OL,3,GNEWSABudget gap at 'extremely fragile' 
OL,4,Acouncil rises to #71m                  
OL,6,FA council needs to take "urgent action"
OL,7,Fto prevent it going effectively        
OL,8,Fbankrupt after its budget gap for      
OL,9,F2027/28 rose to #71.3m, its own finance
OL,10,Fboss has said.                         
OL,12,FLizzie Watkin, Somerset Council's chief
OL,13,Ffinance officer, said the local        
OL,14,Fauthority's financial position was     
OL,15,F"extremely fragile" due to overspends  
OL,16,Fin social services.                    
OL,18,FCouncillor Bill Revans, Lib Dem leader 
OL,19,Fof the council, said: "We have worked  
OL,20,Ftirelessly in recent years to address  
OL,21,Fsoaring costs. But our challenge gets  
OL,22,Fharder and harder every year."         
