OL,3,GNEWSABudget gap at 'extremely fragile' 
OL,4,Acouncil rises to #71m                  
OL,6,FCouncillor Diogo Rodrigues, leader of  
OL,7,Fthe Conservative group, said it was a  
OL,8,F"disaster", adding: "The Liberal       
OL,9,FDemocrats are running out of money,    
OL,10,Frunning out of excuses and running out 
OL,11,Fof time."                              
